OL,3,GNEWSARugby cannot keep relying on
OL,4,ACoventry A&E - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of residents have signed an
OL,7,FMP's open letter calling on NHS bosses
OL,8,Fto provide doctor-led urgent care at a
OL,9,Ftown's hospital, just days after it was
OL,10,Flaunched.
OL,12,FRugby MP John Slinger said the response
OL,13,Fshowed the strength of feeling among
OL,14,Fresidents who believe people in the
OL,15,Ftown should not have to travel to
OL,16,FCoventry for urgent treatment.
OL,18,FThe letter calls for the nurse-led
OL,19,FUrgent Treatment Centre (UTC) at
OL,20,FHospital of St Cross in Rugby to be
OL,21,Fupgraded so more patients can be seen
OL,22,Fby doctors closer to home.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
