OL,3,GNEWSARugby cannot keep relying on
OL,4,ACoventry A&E - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,F"More than 2,300 people have added
OL,7,Ftheir names in just two days. That
OL,8,Fshows how strongly people across Rugby
OL,9,Fand the surrounding area feel that
OL,10,Furgent care needs to improve," Slinger
OL,11,Fsaid.
